  "description": "CreateDatabase(path, dbLangGeneral, dbVersion120); CREATE TABLE V (ID LONG CONSTRAINT PK_V PRIMARY KEY, V LONGBINARY); Close. Then 5 session(s), each adding one row through a table recordset (AddNew, ID, V, Update) and closing: IDs 1-5 with V a Long Binary of patterned bytes (index * 7 + 3, modulo 256): 1, 50, 64, 65 and 99 bytes. Pages 42-53 are read after the create session and after each insert session, and FieldSize read back at the end. Asks where each value is placed (inline in the row, a single LVAL row, chained pages) and which page it takes.",
